          "unit_index": 1,
          "verse": 1,
          "content_chars": 21,
          "text": "1 在提比略凯撒执政第十五年——彼拉多作犹太地方官，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 3,
          "verse": 1,
          "content_chars": 26,
          "text": "他的兄弟腓力作伊图利亚和梯拉孔尼特的四分之一区统治者，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 7,
          "verse": 2,
          "content_chars": 17,
          "text": "他是__PERSON_A__的儿子。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 16,
          "verse": 5,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "5 凡谷都要填满，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 17,
          "verse": 5,
          "content_chars": 11,
          "text": "一切山岗和小山都必削平。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 18,
          "verse": 5,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "崎岖的地方要变为平坦，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 21,
          "verse": 6,
          "content_chars": 12,
          "text": "6 众人都要见到至高者的拯救。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 24,
          "verse": 7,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "“毒蛇的种类！"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 25,
          "verse": 7,
          "content_chars": 14,
          "text": "是谁警告你们躲避将来的忿怒呢？"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 38,
          "verse": 11,
          "content_chars": 5,
          "text": "11 约翰回答说："
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 39,
          "verse": 11,
          "content_chars": 6,
          "text": "“有两件衣服的，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 50,
          "verse": 13,
          "content_chars": 11,
          "text": "“不要多收超出规定的税款。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 60,
          "verse": 15,
          "content_chars": 13,
          "text": "心里议论是否约翰就是那基督。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 62,
          "verse": 16,
          "content_chars": 8,
          "text": "“我用水给你们施洗，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 72,
          "verse": 18,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "宣讲福音。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 75,
          "verse": 19,
          "content_chars": 10,
          "text": "以及他所行的其他恶事，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 78,
          "verse": 21,
          "content_chars": 7,
          "text": "21 当众人都受洗时，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 82,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 13,
          "text": "22 圣灵像鸽子形状降临在他身上，"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 85,
          "verse": 22,
          "content_chars": 4,
          "text": "我喜悦你。"
        },
        {
          "unit_index": 87,
